Usage: agent-deck session redeliver <send-id> --request-id K [--check-only] [--json]
Reconcile late landings; release queued input or reopen a recent untyped failure with a guarded child.
Typed/submitted sends are only rescanned, never re-sent. Cancelled sends stay cancelled.
Outcomes: already_landed, landed, pending, refused, blocked_unknown, unsupported, not_found, conflict.
  -check-only
    	Inspect eligibility/proof without changing records, binding keys or starting workers
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -request-id string
    	Stable operation key (required; reuse it after a lost response)
